Copyparty for Android bundles third-party software.

copyparty (https://github.com/9001/copyparty)
  License: MIT
  Installed into the APK at build time as the Python package "copyparty" (pinned in app/build.gradle.kts).

Chaquopy (https://chaquo.com/chaquopy/)
  License: MIT
  Embedded CPython interpreter and Gradle plugin.

Jinja2 (https://palletsprojects.com/projects/jinja/)
  License: BSD-3-Clause
  Required by copyparty for its HTML rendering.

MarkupSafe (https://palletsprojects.com/projects/markupsafe/)
  License: BSD-3-Clause
  Transitive dependency of Jinja2.

ZXing core (https://github.com/zxing/zxing)
  License: Apache-2.0
  QR code generation for the server address.

AndroidX / Jetpack Compose / Kotlin / kotlinx.serialization
  Licenses: Apache-2.0 (AndroidX, Kotlin), Apache-2.0 (kotlinx.serialization)
